      <title>Bitcoin Miners Hammered Again as Price Rout Squeezes Margins</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bitcoin-miners-hammered-again-as-price-rout-squeezes-margins</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">24a832b048f8b0fbb177cfb6</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:48:55 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>The plunge in the value of Bitcoin is putting pressure on billion-dollar mining companies to liquidate their remaining token reserves, both to cover steep operating costs and to fund an increasingly strained pivot into AI data centers.</description>
