      <title>Bitcoin Lingers Near Low as ETF Outflows Approach $5 Billion</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bitcoin-funds-head-for-worst-month-as-outflows-near-5-billion</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">b02df09df5ae338fe2124ee8</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:01:42 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Bitcoin lingered near its lowest level in more than two years, keeping it on pace for the worst monthly rout since June 2022 as investors pulled nearly $5 billion from US exchange-traded funds holding the cryptocurrency.</description>
